      "side": 1,
      "message": "Creating access rules are indirectly project specific, yes. My thinking here was that a system admin should be able to manage them and clean them up, since they aren\u0027t automatically deleted when an app cred is deleted. An access rule record isn\u0027t specific to a particular app cred, they are only specific to a user, so they won\u0027t be duplicated except when different users create the same ones.",
